SUMMARY:Total solar eclipse
LOCATION:Sky event\; visibility region in description\, Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Totality crossed Greenland\, Iceland\, Spain\, Russia\, and a s
 mall part of Portugal\; Toronto experienced a partial eclipse. NASA gives 
 greatest eclipse at 17:47:06 TD (17:46 UT). Eclipse entries distinguish ph
 ysical visibility from the political\, ritual\, and mythic interpretations
  historically attached to eclipses.
